=== Awaiting one after the other ===
    A starts
    A done after 0.3s
    B starts
    B done after 0.3s
  elapsed 0.60s  ['A-result', 'B-result']

=== Awaiting both together ===
    A starts
    B starts
    A done after 0.3s
    B done after 0.3s
  elapsed 0.30s  ['A-result', 'B-result']

One thread, two tasks. The second run is not faster because
it used two CPUs; it is faster because A's WAIT overlapped B's.
